        },
        {
          "text": "Amubone mbulubede olo luyando lupati ndwaakatupa Taata lwakuti tubandwe kuti mbana ba-Leza, nkabela mbubonya obo mbutubede ncobeni. Nkaambo kaako nyika tiituzi, nkaambo alakwe teeyakamuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
