                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino luyando lwa-Leza tulalubona boobu, nkaambo wakatutulila buumi bwakwe, nkabela aswebo tuleelede kutula buumi bwesu nkaambo kabeenzuma. ",
          "type": "text",
