        },
        {
          "text": "Pele oyo uujisi imbono zyaansi ano, nekubaboobo naabona mweenzinyina uubulide ulamujalila luzyalo lwakwe, ino luyando lwa-Leza lulakala buti mulinguwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
